    <briefdescription>
<para>Query plan rewrite rules for spatial queries in Phase 6C. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>1.0.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Maturity: 🟢 PRODUCTION-READY </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Phase 6C Q3 2026 Delivery</para>
</simplesect>
ThemisDB | Query Module Phase 6C: Geospatial Phase 2</para>
<para>Implements 5 spatial query rewrite rules:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Index path reordering (early filtering)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Distance-based ordering optimization</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Intersection optimization (decomposition)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Redundant predicate elimination</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Predicate pushdown (move toward source) </para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
